	"data": "Weekly Meal Plan — Week of August 24, 2026\n\nFor: One person | Focus: Lean, high quality, realistic weeknight cooking\n\nPrep Notes (Sunday Evening)\n\nBefore the week starts, do these 20 minutes of prep:\nCook 1 cup dry quinoa — yields ~3 cups cooked. Use Mon lunch + Wed dinner.\nHard-boil 4 eggs — for Tue/Wed breakfast protein add-on and Thu lunch.\nMix granola into yogurt portions in 7 containers for grab-and-go breakfasts.\nWash and dry all greens — store with paper towel in container.\nMarinate…",
